  "contract": [
    "An explicit source authority or policy change starts a new permission context. Previous approval cannot authorize it.",
    "Alias history belongs to an authority and policy pair. A separately authorized replacement supplies its complete inventory. Ordinary and same-context updates retain alias history.",
    "A runtime without retained source inputs keeps the selected stored catalog for diagnostics and blocks inference until approved source activation.",
    "Failed catalog writes preserve the prior catalog. Restart recovers staged inputs before retry. Successful replacement and its approval survive a retained offline restart."
  ],
