  "limitations": [
    "The source and clock fixtures are deterministic. Tests use a memory catalog store and a real local input journal. They do not qualify distributed backend recovery or Starport production clock composition.",
    "The 109 passing race events per toolchain cover source 5066856d. The combined source d1bb47e1 still needs its full verifier, task gate, required review, publication, native checks, and merge.",
